#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:1
msgid "to_buffer"
msgstr "to_buffer"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:3
msgid "1. 硬件背景"
msgstr "1. Hardware Background"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:5
msgid "用于将 tl.tensor 张量对象 转换为昇腾硬件专用的 bl.buffer 缓冲区对象，是张量与硬件内存缓冲区的核心转换接口。"
msgstr ""
"Used to convert a `tl.tensor` object into a `bl.buffer` object specific"
"to Ascend hardware. It is the core conversion interface between tensors"
"and hardware memory buffers."

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:7
msgid "2. 接口定义"
msgstr "2. Interface Definition"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:15
msgid "3. 参数说明"
msgstr "3. Parameter Description"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:50
msgid "4. 返回值"
msgstr "4. Return Value"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:52
msgid "返回与输入张量对应的 bl.buffer 对象"
msgstr "Returns the `bl.buffer` object corresponding to the input tensor."

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:54
msgid "若传入 bind_buffer 参数，直接返回该绑定缓冲区本身"
msgstr ""
"If a `bind_buffer` parameter is provided, the function returns that"
"bound buffer directly."

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:56
msgid "5. 约束说明"
msgstr "5. Constraints"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:58
msgid "接口约束规则与 bl.allocate_local_buffer 保持一致"
msgstr ""
"The interface follows the same constraint rules as"
"`bl.allocate_local_buffer`."

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:60
msgid "地址空间参数需严格匹配昇腾硬件支持的内存区域（UB/L1/L0A/L0B/L0C）"
msgstr ""
"The address-space parameter must strictly match memory regions"
"supported by Ascend hardware (UB/L1/L0A/L0B/L0C)."

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:62
msgid "6. 完整使用示例"
msgstr "6. Complete Example"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:64
msgid "基础用法（内核定义 + 编译验证）"
msgstr "Basic Usage (Kernel Definition + Compilation Verification)"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:72
msgid "进阶用法（编译 + 打印 IR）"
msgstr "Advanced Usage (Compilation + IR Printing)"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:80
msgid "7. 核心说明"
msgstr "7. Key Notes"

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:82
msgid "该接口是 张量 ↔ 硬件缓冲区 的核心转换入口"
msgstr ""
"This interface is the core entry point for converting between tensors"
"and hardware buffers."

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:84
msgid "支持手动指定昇腾全系列硬件地址空间（UB/L1/L0）"
msgstr ""
"Supports manual selection of the full set of Ascend hardware address"
"spaces (UB/L1/L0)."

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:86
msgid "支持绑定现有缓冲区，满足精细化内存管理需求"
msgstr ""
"Supports binding to existing buffers to satisfy fine-grained memory"
"management requirements."

#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/bl/to_buffer.md:88
msgid "仅可在 @triton.jit 修饰的内核函数中使用"
msgstr "Can only be used inside kernel functions decorated with `@triton.jit`."

